  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Urban Productive Safety Net Program MultiDonor Trust Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The development objective of the Trust Fund would be to support thimplementation of the Urban Productive Safety Net Program (UPNSP) and its successor project, the Urban Productive Safety Net and Jobs Project(UPSNJP), to, inter alia, implement COVID-19 related activities, andpilot the integration of refugees and host communities.</narrative>
  </description>
